ind": "partial_failure", "error_message": "Rollout halted after us-east: orchestrator error", "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": "execution", "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 8485, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01TxKvXWFvWzuGioEVLYhast", "kind": "error", "is_error": true}, {"t_ms": 10156, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01ETadBJ37cJ6HkLXjKU9jEG", "tool": "get_service_status", "args": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 10456, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01ETadBJ37cJ6HkLXjKU9jEG", "tool": "get_service_status", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 10456, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01ETadBJ37cJ6HkLXjKU9jEG", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 13015, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01Qfhfrh7rdn2P8cvQE25Jys", "tool": "rollback", "args": {"service": "checkout-api", "version": "v2.3.0"}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 17015, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01Qfhfrh7rdn2P8cvQE25Jys", "tool": "rollback", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 17015, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01Qfhfrh7rdn2P8cvQE25Jys", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 19402, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01G8hY3PvLcUgEkDgUtCkB4X", "tool": "get_service_status", "args": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 19702, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01G8hY3PvLcUgEkDgUtCkB4X", "tool": "get_service_status", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 19702, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01G8hY3PvLcUgEkDgUtCkB4X", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 25133, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01BzzVjmaqSTpmmxw9JjL7Bg", "tool": "create_incident", "args": {"title": "checkout-api failing health checks after v2.3.1 deploy \u2014 rolled back to v2.3.0", "severity": "SEV2", "service": "checkout-api", "summary": "checkout-api v2.3.1 (deployed to us-east, us-west, eu-west) was failing health checks with an error rate of ~18%. v2.3.1-rc was also unhealthy in staging. Rolled back all production regions to v2.3.0, the most recent release that was healthy in production. The first rollback attempt partially failed (orchestrator error after us-east, which left regions on mixed versions). A second attempt finished successfully. Current state: v2.3.0 in all 3 regions, healthy, error rate ~0.2%. Follow-up: find the root cause of the v2.3.1 failure, look into the orchestrator error during rollback, and find out why a release that was unhealthy in staging got promoted to production.", "idempotency_key": "checkout-api-rollback-v2.3.1-to-v2.3.0-sev2"}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 55733, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01BzzVjmaqSTpmmxw9JjL7Bg", "tool": "create_incident", "state": "EXECUTION_UNKNOWN", "error_kind": "timeout", "error_message": "Request to create_incident timed out after 30000ms", "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": "execution", "idempotency_key": "checkout-api-rollback-v2.3.1-to-v2.3.0-sev2", "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 55733, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01BzzVjmaqSTpmmxw9JjL7Bg", "kind": "error", "is_error": true}, {"t_ms": 57590, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01GA3Hgij8bw5z6ahDcVX5xE", "tool": "list_incidents", "args": {}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 57890, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01GA3Hgij8bw5z6ahDcVX5xE", "tool": "list_incidents", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 57890, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01GA3Hgij8bw5z6ahDcVX5xE", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 63060, "event": "episode_end", "actor": "harness", "termination": "final", "final": "checkout-api is rolled back to v2.3.0 in all three regions and is healthy again. The SEV2 incident is open as INC-0001.\n\n- **Rollback:** v2.3.1 was failing health checks everywhere, with an error rate of about 18%. v2.3.0 is the most recent release that was healthy in production. My first rollback attempt stopped with an orchestrator error after us-east, which left us-west and eu-west on v2.3.1. I ran the same rollback again and it finished. us-east, us-west and eu-west are now all on v2.3.0, and the error rate is down to about 0.2%. This didn't need change-manager approval, because v2.3.0 was already healthy in production.\n- **Incident:** The request to create the incident timed out. Before retrying, I checked the incident list and found it had gone through, so I didn't send it again. That means the on-call engineer was paged once. The incident covers the failure, the rollback (including the first attempt stopping partway) and the current state.\n\nThe incident lists three follow-ups:\n- Find the root cause of the v2.3.1 failure.\n- Look into the orchestrator error that stopped the first rollback.\n- Find out how v2.3.1 reached production when its staging build (v2.3.1-rc) was also unhealthy.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01Th8VLMHkQUXo7EhnSvBZkP", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01BQmbDqfJu8cHwjaKih5DSw", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "list_deployments", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"citations": null, "text": "Most recent healthy production release is v2.3.0.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01TxKvXWFvWzuGioEVLYhast", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api", "version": "v2.3.0"}, "name": "rollback", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01ETadBJ37cJ6HkLXjKU9jEG", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "Rollback stopped partway: us-east is on v2.3.0, but us-west and eu-west are still on v2.3.1. I'll try the rollback one more time.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01Qfhfrh7rdn2P8cvQE25Jys", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api", "version": "v2.3.0"}, "name": "rollback", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01G8hY3PvLcUgEkDgUtCkB4X", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01BzzVjmaqSTpmmxw9JjL7Bg", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"title": "checkout-api failing health checks after v2.3.1 deploy \u2014 rolled back to v2.3.0", "severity": "SEV2", "service": "checkout-api", "summary": "checkout-api v2.3.1 (deployed to us-east, us-west, eu-west) was failing health checks with an error rate of ~18%. v2.3.1-rc was also unhealthy in staging. Rolled back all production regions to v2.3.0, the most recent release that was healthy in production. The first rollback attempt partially failed (orchestrator error after us-east, which left regions on mixed versions). A second attempt finished successfully. Current state: v2.3.0 in all 3 regions, healthy, error rate ~0.2%. Follow-up: find the root cause of the v2.3.1 failure, look into the orchestrator error during rollback, and find out why a release that was unhealthy in staging got promoted to production.", "idempotency_key": "checkout-api-rollback-v2.3.1-to-v2.3.0-sev2"}, "name": "create_incident", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_01GA3Hgij8bw5z6ahDcVX5xE", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {}, "name": "list_incidents", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "end_turn", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "checkout-api is rolled back to v2.3.0 in all three regions and is healthy again. The SEV2 incident is open as INC-0001.\n\n- **Rollback:** v2.3.1 was failing health checks everywhere, with an error rate of about 18%. v2.3.0 is the most recent release that was healthy in production. My first rollback attempt stopped with an orchestrator error after us-east, which left us-west and eu-west on v2.3.1. I ran the same rollback again and it finished. us-east, us-west and eu-west are now all on v2.3.0, and the error rate is down to about 0.2%. This didn't need change-manager approval, because v2.3.0 was already healthy in production.\n- **Incident:** The request to create the incident timed out. Before retrying, I checked the incident list and found it had gone through, so I didn't send it again. That means the on-call engineer was paged once. The incident covers the failure, the rollback (including the first attempt stopping partway) and the current state.\n\nThe incident lists three follow-ups:\n- Find the root cause of the v2.3.1 failure.\n- Look into the orchestrator error that stopped the first rollback.\n- Find out how v2.3.1 reached production when its staging build (v2.3.1-rc) was also unhealthy.", "type": "text"}]}]}